<title>UK: Soya carrier still waiting for tug off Madagascar.</title>
<headline>Soya carrier still waiting for tug off Madagascar.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liberian-flagged bulk carrier Askania Nova remains stationary awaiting a tug south of Madagascar, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>A tug was expected to arrive on Thursday to assist the 52,450 dwt bulker, with its cargo of soya. Another vessel was on station one nautical mile off the Askania Nova.</p>
</text>
